					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p>Brother Nevryn has compared the sounds to the moans of the Mother That Demands One's Toes. We have elected to remove this from the current edition of this article so fewer beings attempt to search up this noise. ~ G.</p> </blockquote> <p>Pffffffft upvote. Yep, right here is where I gave my upvote. This is honestly great, and that's coming from someone who usually finds themselves annoyed or bored with SH entries for the most part.</p> <p>Ever since you pitched this, I was wondering how the hell you'd pull it off. Good shit dude, good shit.</p> 
				 	]]>
